{{ModBox}}
<section begin="intro" />
'''Eject Magazine''' is an [[:Category:Exilus Weapon Mods|Exilus Weapon Mod]] for [[:Category:Pistol Mods|secondaries]] that are usable in both PvE and [[Conclave]] that [[reload]]s a portion of a secondary weapon's [[Ammo|magazine]] for each second while holstered.<section end=intro />

==Stats==
{| class="emodtable"
|-
! [[Mod#Mod Rank|Rank]]
! Effect
! [[Mod#Attributes|Cost]]
|-
| 0 || +5%  || 6
|-
| 1 || +10% || 7
|-
| 2 || +15% || 8
|-
| 3 || +20% || 9
|}

==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Whirlwind''' under the [[Conclave]] [[Syndicate]], and spending {{sc|15,000}} to purchase.
*This mod can be obtained as a drop from [[Battalyst]]s.

==Drop Locations==
{{DropLocations}}

==Notes==
*Stacks additively with other methods of reload while holstered. 
*Cannot be equipped on the following AoE weapons with the hidden <code>AOE</code> [[Compatibility Tag]]. The following weapons with cannot equip the mod:
{{Column|2|
::*{{Weapon|Aegrit}}
::*{{Weapon|Akarius}} ({{Weapon|Akarius Prime|Prime}})
::*{{Weapon|Angstrum}} ({{Weapon|Prisma Angstrum|Prisma}})
::*{{Weapon|Castanas}} ({{Weapon|Sancti Castanas|Sancti}})
::*{{Weapon|Embolist}}
::*{{Weapon|Epitaph}}
::*{{Weapon|Laetum}}
::*{{Weapon|Kompressa}}
::*{{Weapon|Kulstar}}
::*{{Weapon|Pox}}
::*{{Weapon|Sepulcrum}}
::*{{Weapon|Staticor}}
::*{{Weapon|Stug}}
::*{{Weapon|Talons}}
::*{{Weapon|Tenet Plinx}}
::*{{Weapon|Tenet Spirex}}
::*{{Weapon|Zakti}} ({{Weapon|Zakti Prime|Prime}})
}}
*The following weapons can equip the mod despite possessing an AoE component:
{{Column|1|
::*{{Weapon|Catabolyst}}
::*{{Weapon|Cyanex}}
::*{{Weapon|Grimoire}}
::*{{Weapon|Kuva Seer}}
::*{{Weapon|Zymos}}
}}
*This mod reloads a portion of your weapon's magazine every second. It will not replenish a weapon's total ammo pool, and will partially reload the magazine if there is less than a full magazine of ammo in the weapon's total pool.\
*Bonus stacks additively with the [[Set Mods#Synth Mod Set|Synth mod set bonus]].

{{Clr}}

==Patch History==
{{Scrollbox/Article|
{{ver|27.0.12}}
*Fixed Eject Magazine Mod not functioning for Clients.

{{ver|26}}
*Now an Exilus Weapon mod.
*Mod capacity drain from 13 to 9

{{ver|20}}
*Fixed the Tactical Reload and Eject Magazine mods not automatically reloading on a holstered weapon after Clients use Transference from Operator to Warframe.

{{ver|17.9}}
*The following Conclave Mods can now be used in PvE:
**Eject Magazine / Tactical Reload / Lock and Load (Pistol/Rifle/Shotgun) - weapons reload while holstered.

{{ver|16}}
*Introduced.
}}

==See also==
*{{M|Tactical Reload}}, the rifle version of this mod.
*{{M|Lock and Load}}, the shotgun version.

